- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - system_crash
    fields: []
  description: 进程意外消失，可能是 OOM、信号终止或人为 kill
  id: SYS-001
  layer: system
  name: 进程崩溃/消失
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type='system_crash' AND timestamp > ?

    GROUP BY system

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - error
    fields:
    - error_type
  description: 进程内存溢出，通常是内存不足或内存泄漏导致
  id: SYS-002
  layer: system
  name: 内存溢出（OOM）
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type='error' AND timestamp > ?

    AND (json_extract(payload, '\1') LIKE '\1' OR json_extract(payload,
    '\1') LIKE '\1' OR json_extract(payload, '\1') LIKE
    '\1')

    GROUP BY system

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - platform_snapshot
    fields:
    - vm_rss_kb
  description: RSS 近期均值显著高于早期均值（≥1.8x），疑似内存持续泄漏而非正常波动
  id: SYS-003
  layer: system
  name: 内存持续增长（泄漏）
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n  AVG(CASE WHEN timestamp > CAST(strftime('%s', 'now',\
    \ '-15 minutes') AS REAL) THEN json_extract(payload, '$.vm_rss_kb') END) as recent_rss,\n\
    \  AVG(CASE WHEN timestamp <= CAST(strftime('%s', 'now', '-15 minutes') AS REAL)\
    \ THEN json_extract(payload, '$.vm_rss_kb') END) as early_rss\nFROM events WHERE\
    \ event_type='platform_snapshot' AND timestamp > ?\nAND system IN ('__host__',\
    \ 'openclaw')\nGROUP BY system HAVING recent_rss > early_rss * 1.8\n"
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - platform_snapshot
    fields:
    - vm_size_kb
    - vm_rss_kb
    - proc_name
    - proc_exe
  description: 虚拟内存远超物理内存（Node.js 阈值 30GB，其他 5GB，容器环境下更宽容）
  env_thresholds:
    baremetal:
      swap_gap_base_kb: 5242880
      swap_gap_node_kb: 31457280
    container:
      swap_gap_base_kb: 10485760
      swap_gap_node_kb: 41943040
    vm:
      swap_gap_base_kb: 5242880
      swap_gap_node_kb: 31457280
  id: SYS-004
  layer: system
  name: 虚拟内存异常膨胀
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       AVG(json_extract(payload, '$.vm_size_kb')\
    \ - json_extract(payload, '$.vm_rss_kb')) as swap_gap,\n       MAX(json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.proc_exe')) as proc_exe\nFROM events WHERE event_type='platform_snapshot'\
    \ AND timestamp > ?\nAND system IN ('__host__', 'openclaw')\nGROUP BY system\n\
    HAVING swap_gap > IIF(MAX(json_extract(payload, '$.proc_exe')) LIKE '%node%' OR\
    \ COALESCE(MAX(json_extract(payload, '$.proc_name')),'') LIKE '%node%', {env.swap_gap_node_kb},\
    \ {env.swap_gap_base_kb})\n"
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - platform_snapshot
    fields:
    - fd_count
  description: 文件描述符数量持续增长，可能未正确关闭文件/连接
  id: SYS-005
  layer: system
  name: 文件描述符泄漏
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system, MIN(json_extract(payload, '$.fd_count')) as min_fd,\n\
    \       MAX(json_extract(payload, '$.fd_count')) as max_fd\nFROM events WHERE\
    \ event_type='platform_snapshot' AND timestamp > ?\nAND system IN ('__host__',\
    \ 'openclaw') AND json_extract(payload, '$.fd_count') > 0\nGROUP BY system HAVING\
    \ max_fd > min_fd * 2 AND max_fd > 200\n"
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - platform_snapshot
    fields:
    - threads
  description: 线程数异常增长，可能导致上下文切换开销暴增
  id: SYS-006
  layer: system
  name: 线程爆炸
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, MAX(json_extract(payload, '$.threads')) as max_threads

    FROM events WHERE event_type='platform_snapshot' AND timestamp > ?

    AND system IN ('\1', '\1') AND json_extract(payload, '$.threads')
    > 0

    GROUP BY system HAVING max_threads > 200

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - __health__
    fields:
    - disk_free_mb
  description: 磁盘剩余空间低于 500MB，可能导致日志写入失败
  id: SYS-007
  layer: system
  name: 磁盘空间不足
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, json_extract(payload, '$.disk_free_mb') as free_mb

    FROM events WHERE event_type='__health__' AND timestamp > ?

    AND json_extract(payload, '$.disk_free_mb') < 500

    ORDER BY json_extract(payload, '$.disk_free_mb') ASC LIMIT 5

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - platform_snapshot
    fields:
    - vm_rss_kb
  description: PID 存活但 10 分钟内无事件发出，可能已僵死
  id: SYS-008
  layer: system
  name: 静默异常（僵尸进程）
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, MAX(timestamp) as last_event

    FROM events WHERE system != '\1' AND timestamp > ?

    GROUP BY system HAVING last_event < CAST(strftime('\1', '\1', '\1')
    AS REAL)

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - __health__
    fields:
    - _clock_skew
  description: 系统时钟与标准时间偏差过大，影响事件排序和诊断
  id: SYS-009
  disabled: true
  disabled_reason: __health__ payload 结构已改变，无 _clock_skew 字段
  layer: system
  name: 时钟偏移
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type='__health__' AND timestamp > ?

    AND json_extract(payload, '\1') = 1

    GROUP BY system

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - io_anomaly
    fields:
    - fd_type
  description: 异常文件打开模式，可能是恶意行为或配置错误
  id: SYS-010
  layer: system
  name: IO 异常（异常文件打开）
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type='io_anomaly' AND timestamp > ?

    AND json_extract(payload, '\1') = '\1'

    GROUP BY system

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - platform_snapshot
    fields:
    - io_write_bytes
  description: 短时间写入量暴增，可能是日志风暴或数据异常
  id: SYS-011
  layer: system
  name: IO 写入量异常
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, MAX(json_extract(payload, '$.io_write_bytes')) as
    max_write

    FROM events WHERE event_type='platform_snapshot' AND timestamp > ?

    AND system IN ('\1', '\1') AND json_extract(payload, '$.io_write_bytes')
    > 0

    GROUP BY system HAVING max_write > 1073741824

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - platform_snapshot
    fields:
    - io_read_bytes
  description: 短时间读取量暴增，可能是缓存失效或全表扫描
  id: SYS-012
  layer: system
  name: IO 读取量异常
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, MAX(json_extract(payload, '$.io_read_bytes')) as
    max_read

    FROM events WHERE event_type='platform_snapshot' AND timestamp > ?

    AND system IN ('\1', '\1') AND json_extract(payload, '$.io_read_bytes')
    > 0

    GROUP BY system HAVING max_read > 1073741824

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - __health__
    fields: []
  description: 归档器心跳停止，事件无法持久化
  id: SYS-013
  layer: system
  name: 归档器死亡
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: 'SELECT 1 FROM events WHERE event_type='__health__' AND timestamp
    > ?

    LIMIT 1

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - __health__
    fields: []
  description: 归档器 10 分钟内无心跳，可能存在性能瓶颈
  id: SYS-014
  layer: system
  name: 归档器心跳迟缓
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: 'SELECT MAX(timestamp) as last_heartbeat FROM events

    WHERE event_type='__health__' AND timestamp > ?

    HAVING last_heartbeat < CAST(strftime('\1', '\1', '\1') AS REAL)

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - __detach__
    fields: []
  description: 探针主动断开监控连接，可能是被业务系统拒绝
  id: SYS-015
  layer: system
  name: 探针监控中断
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type='__detach__' AND timestamp > ?

    GROUP BY system

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - platform_snapshot
    fields:
    - platform_unreliable
  description: Windows 平台指标采集不完整，诊断精度受限
  id: SYS-016
  layer: system
  name: Windows 指标不可靠
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type='platform_snapshot' AND timestamp > ?

    AND json_extract(payload, '\1') = 1

    GROUP BY system

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - platform_snapshot
    fields:
    - load_avg_1m
    - cpu_count
  description: 1 分钟负载超过 CPU 核心数的 80%，CPU 可能成为瓶颈
  id: SYS-017
  layer: system
  name: CPU 负荷高
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system, json_extract(payload, '$.load_avg_1m') as load1,\n\
    \       json_extract(payload, '$.cpu_count') as cpus\nFROM events WHERE event_type='platform_snapshot'\
    \ AND timestamp > ?\nAND json_extract(payload, '$.load_avg_1m') > 0\nAND json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.cpu_count') > 0\nAND json_extract(payload, '$.load_avg_1m') > json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.cpu_count') * 0.8\nGROUP BY system\n"
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - platform_snapshot
    fields:
    - load_avg_5m
    - cpu_count
  description: 5 分钟负载超过 CPU 核心数的 120%，系统持续过载，需立即干预
  id: SYS-018
  layer: system
  name: CPU 持续过载
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: "SELECT system, json_extract(payload, '$.load_avg_5m') as load5,\n\
    \       json_extract(payload, '$.cpu_count') as cpus\nFROM events WHERE event_type='platform_snapshot'\
    \ AND timestamp > ?\nAND json_extract(payload, '$.load_avg_5m') > 0\nAND json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.cpu_count') > 0\nAND json_extract(payload, '$.load_avg_5m') > json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.cpu_count') * 1.2\nGROUP BY system\n"
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - platform_snapshot
    fields:
    - load_avg_1m
    - load_avg_5m
  description: CPU 1 分钟 load 短时间内暴增 3 倍以上，可能存在 CPU 风暴
  id: SYS-019
  layer: system
  name: CPU Load 异常飙升
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n  AVG(CASE WHEN timestamp > CAST(strftime('%s', 'now',\
    \ '-5 minutes') AS REAL) THEN json_extract(payload, '$.load_avg_1m') END) as recent,\n\
    \  AVG(CASE WHEN timestamp <= CAST(strftime('%s', 'now', '-5 minutes') AS REAL)\
    \ THEN json_extract(payload, '$.load_avg_1m') END) as earlier\nFROM events WHERE\
    \ event_type='platform_snapshot' AND timestamp > ?\nAND json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.load_avg_1m') > 0\nGROUP BY system HAVING recent > earlier * 3 AND recent\
    \ > 2.0\n"
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    - tool_call
    fields:
    - layer_network.tcp_connected_ms
  description: TCP 连接失败，网络不通或目标主机不可达
  id: NET-017
  layer: network
  name: 网络不通（TCP 连接失败）
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type IN ('\1', '\1') AND timestamp > ?

    AND json_extract(payload, '\1') = 0

    GROUP BY system

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    - tool_call
    fields:
    - layer_network.dns_resolved
  description: DNS 解析失败，域名无法解析
  id: NET-018
  layer: network
  name: 网络不通（DNS 解析失败）
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type IN ('\1', '\1') AND timestamp > ?

    AND json_extract(payload, '\1') = 0

    GROUP BY system

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    - tool_call
    fields:
    - layer_network.status_code
  description: HTTP 客户端错误频繁，可能是认证失败或参数错误
  id: NET-019
  layer: network
  name: HTTP 4xx 客户端错误
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type IN ('\1', '\1') AND timestamp > ?

    AND json_extract(payload, '\1') BETWEEN 400 AND 499

    GROUP BY system

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    - tool_call
    fields:
    - layer_network.status_code
  description: HTTP 服务端错误频繁，目标服务可能不稳定
  id: NET-020
  layer: network
  name: HTTP 5xx 服务端错误
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type IN ('\1', '\1') AND timestamp > ?

    AND json_extract(payload, '\1') BETWEEN 500 AND 599

    GROUP BY system

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    - tool_call
    fields:
    - layer_network.target_host
    - layer_network.status_code
  description: 特定目标主机错误率超过 30%，该服务可能存在问题
  id: NET-021
  layer: network
  name: 特定 Host 频繁失败
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_network.target_host')\
    \ as host,\n       COUNT(*) as total,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.layer_network.status_code') >= 400 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as errors\nFROM events\
    \ WHERE event_type IN ('llm_invoke', 'tool_call') AND timestamp > ?\nAND json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.layer_network.target_host') IS NOT NULL\nGROUP BY system, host HAVING errors\
    \ * 1.0 / total > 0.3 AND total > 10\n"
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    - tool_call
    fields:
    - layer_network.tcp_connected_ms
    - layer_network.status_code
  description: TCP 连接成功但未收到 HTTP 响应，可能是半开连接
  id: NET-022
  layer: network
  name: 半开连接
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type IN ('\1', '\1') AND timestamp > ?

    AND json_extract(payload, '\1') > 0

    AND json_extract(payload, '\1') IS NULL

    GROUP BY system

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    - tool_call
    fields:
    - layer_network.tls_handshake_ms
  description: TLS 握手耗时超过 5 秒，证书验证或网络可能有问题
  id: NET-023
  layer: network
  name: TLS 握手超时
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type IN ('\1', '\1') AND timestamp > ?

    AND json_extract(payload, '\1') > 5000

    GROUP BY system

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    fields:
    - layer_network.tcp_connected_ms
    - layer_llm.latency_ms
  description: 网络层连接失败导致 LLM 无响应，根因是网络分区而非模型延迟
  id: NET-024
  layer: network
  name: 网络分区（非 LLM 延迟）
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type='llm_invoke' AND timestamp > ?

    AND json_extract(payload, '\1') = 0

    AND json_extract(payload, '\1') > 10000

    GROUP BY system

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    - tool_call
    fields:
    - layer_network.target_host
    - timestamp
  description: 同一目标主机并发连接数过高，可能连接池耗尽
  id: NET-027
  layer: network
  name: 连接池耗尽
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_network.target_host')\
    \ as host,\n       COUNT(*) as concurrent\nFROM events WHERE event_type IN ('llm_invoke',\
    \ 'tool_call') AND timestamp > ?\nAND json_extract(payload, '$.layer_network.target_host')\
    \ IS NOT NULL\nGROUP BY system, host, strftime('%s', datetime(timestamp, 'unixepoch'))\
    \ / 10\nHAVING concurrent > 50\n"
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - __register__
    - llm_invoke
    fields:
    - timestamp
  description: 注册到首次业务事件间隔过长，冷启动延迟
  id: NET-028
  layer: network
  name: 冷启动延迟
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system, \n       (SELECT MIN(timestamp) FROM events WHERE\
    \ event_type='llm_invoke' AND system = r.system AND timestamp > maxts) - maxts\
    \ as startup_delay\nFROM (SELECT system, MAX(timestamp) as maxts FROM events WHERE\
    \ event_type='__register__' AND timestamp > ? GROUP BY system) r\nWHERE startup_delay\
    \ IS NOT NULL AND startup_delay > 30\n"
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    - tool_call
    fields:
    - layer_network.status_code
  description: LLM API 返回 429，触发速率限制，需检查并发/配额/退避策略
  id: NET-029
  layer: network
  name: LLM Rate Limit（限流）
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type IN ('\1', '\1') AND timestamp > ?

    AND json_extract(payload, '\1') = 429

    GROUP BY system

    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    - tool_call
    fields:
    - layer_network.status_code
  description: LLM API 返回 401/403，API Key 过期或无权限，业务立即中断
  id: NET-030
  layer: network
  name: LLM 认证失败
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
