    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    - tool_call
    fields:
    - layer_network.status_code
  description: LLM API 返回 500，服务端内部错误，可能模型推理异常或后端崩溃
  id: NET-032
  layer: network
  name: LLM 服务端内部错误
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events

    WHERE event_type IN ('\1', '\1') AND timestamp > ?

