- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    fields:
    - layer_llm.finish_reason
  description: LLM 输出因 token 限制被截断，可能需要增大 max_tokens
  id: MDL-029
  layer: model
  name: LLM 输出被截断
  scope: observable
