    '
- applicable: all
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    fields:
    - layer_llm.finish_reason
  description: LLM 输出被内容过滤器拦截，可能触发安全策略
  id: MDL-030
  layer: model
  name: LLM 内容被过滤
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
