    - kunxiansuo.schema_error
    fields: []
  description: LLM 调用土行孙工具时频繁传入不符合 Schema 的参数，建议调整 prompt 或检查工具定义
  id: TLT-054
  layer: tool
  name: 土行孙 Schema 错误高频
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_agent.session_id')\
    \ as session_id,\n       COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='kunxiansuo.schema_error'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system, session_id\nHAVING cnt > 5\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - kunxiansuo.recovery
    fields: []
  description: 土行孙工具代替链中成功恢复的比例低于 50%，建议检查替代工具映射表
  id: TLT-055
  layer: tool
  name: 土行孙工具自愈成功率异常
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as total,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.success') = true THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as success_cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='kunxiansuo.recovery'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING total > 0 AND CAST(success_cnt AS\
    \ REAL) / total < 0.5\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - sandbox.blocked
    fields: []
  description: Agent 尝试访问被土行孙沙箱保护的路径或执行受限命令，达到告警阈值
  id: SYS-023
  layer: system
  name: 土行孙沙箱入侵告警
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_agent.session_id')\
    \ as session_id,\n       COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='sandbox.blocked'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system, session_id\nHAVING cnt > 2\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - context.trimmed
    fields: []
  description: 土行孙会话上下文超出模型限制导致多次强制截断，建议调整 max_tokens 或启用记忆摘要
  id: AGT-065
  layer: agent
  name: 土行孙上下文频繁强制裁剪
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_agent.session_id')\
    \ as session_id,\n       COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='context.trimmed'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system, session_id\nHAVING cnt > 5\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - __expect__
    fields: []
  description: tool.execute 事件在规定时间内没有配对的 tool.result，可能存在工具执行超时或探针事件丢失
  id: PRB-086
  layer: probe
  name: 土行孙探针事件配对异常
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       COUNT(*) as unfulfilled_cnt FROM expectations\n\
    WHERE system='tusunsun'\n  AND fulfilled = 0\n  AND deadline > ?\nGROUP BY system\n\
    HAVING unfulfilled_cnt >= 1\n"
  depends:
    event_types:
    - kunxiansuo.fuse
    fields: []
  description: 捆仙索在短时间窗口内反复触发熔断，核心防御能力不可用
  id: SYS-024
  always_on: true
  layer: system
  name: 捆仙索反复熔断
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='kunxiansuo.fuse'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 2\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - kunxiansuo.recovered
    fields: []
  description: 捆仙索从故障/熔断状态中恢复，记录恢复事件以监控安全系统稳定性
  id: SYS-025
  layer: system
  name: 捆仙索安全系统恢复
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='kunxiansuo.recovered'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 1\n"
  depends:
    event_types:
    - kunxiansuo.anchor_degraded
    fields: []
  description: 捆仙索锚点降级到极限（硬编码兜底），文件完整性校验强度最低
  id: SYS-026
  always_on: true
  layer: system
  name: 捆仙索锚点完全丢失
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='kunxiansuo.anchor_degraded'\n\
    \  AND json_extract(payload, '$.to_level') >= 3\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY\
    \ system\nHAVING cnt >= 1\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - kunxiansuo.escalation
    fields: []
  description: 工具代替链频繁升级重试，表明底层工具反复失败
  id: TLT-056
  layer: tool
  name: 重试链升级频繁
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='kunxiansuo.escalation'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 3\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - kunxiansuo.recovery
    fields: []
  description: 工具代替链中成功恢复的比例低于 40%，自愈能力显著退化
  id: TLT-057
  layer: tool
  name: 工具自愈能力退化
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as total,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.success') = true THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as success_cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='kunxiansuo.recovery'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING total > 5 AND CAST(success_cnt AS\
    \ REAL) / total < 0.4\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - ying.hash_verify
    fields: []
  description: 番天印记忆哈希链校验失败，记忆完整性受损
  id: MEM-077
  layer: memory
  name: 记忆哈希链损坏
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='ying.hash_verify'\n\
    \  AND json_extract(payload, '$.ok') = false\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\n\
    HAVING cnt >= 1\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - ying.consolidation
    fields: []
  description: 番天印记忆层合并操作无产出，跨层转换可能异常
  id: MEM-078
  layer: memory
  name: 记忆合并异常
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='ying.consolidation'\n\
    \  AND json_extract(payload, '$.items_merged') = 0\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP\
    \ BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 1\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - ying.cache_hit
    fields: []
  description: 番天印记忆缓存未命中率超过 80%，缓存配置可能需要调整
  id: MEM-079
  layer: memory
  name: 记忆缓存命中率低
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as total,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.hit') = false THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) as miss_cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='ying.cache_hit'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING total > 10 AND CAST(miss_cnt AS\
    \ REAL) / total > 0.8\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - ying.retrieve
    fields: []
  description: 番天印记忆召回连续 5 次以上无结果，索引或嵌入模型可能存在异常
  id: MEM-080
  layer: memory
  name: 记忆召回持续为空
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='ying.retrieve'\n\
    \  AND json_extract(payload, '$.results_count') = 0\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP\
    \ BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 5\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - ying.tusunzip
    fields: []
  description: TusunZip 压缩率连续低于 0.3，压缩效果显著退化
  id: MEM-081
  layer: memory
  name: TusunZip 压缩率退化
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system, AVG(json_extract(payload, '$.ratio')) as avg_ratio,\n\
    \       COUNT(*) as cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='ying.tusunzip'\n  AND\
    \ timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 3 AND avg_ratio < 0.3\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - ying.retrieve
    fields: []
  description: 番天印记忆检索延迟超过 1 秒且有结果返回，检索性能告警
  id: MEM-082
  layer: memory
  name: 记忆检索延迟高
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='ying.retrieve'\n\
    \  AND json_extract(payload, '$.latency_ms') > 1000\n  AND json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.results_count') > 0\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >=\
    \ 1\n"
  depends:
    event_types:
    - sandbox.killed
    fields: []
  description: 土行孙沙箱子进程被杀，可能由 OOM Killer 或系统资源耗尽触发
  id: SYS-027
  always_on: true
  layer: system
  name: 沙箱进程被杀
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='sandbox.killed'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 1\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - sandbox.result
    fields: []
  description: 沙箱执行频繁返回失败结果，沙箱内部或执行环境可能存在异常
  id: SYS-028
  layer: system
  name: 沙箱执行失败
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='sandbox.result'\n\
    \  AND json_extract(payload, '$.ok') = false\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\n\
    HAVING cnt >= 2\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - sandbox.execute
    fields: []
  description: 沙箱执行操作频率异常偏高，可能存在工具滥用或死循环
  id: SYS-029
  layer: system
  name: 沙箱操作频率异常
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='sandbox.execute'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 50\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - health.fail
    fields: []
  description: 健康检查端点连续故障，服务可用性受影响
  id: SYS-030
  layer: system
  name: 健康端点故障
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='health.fail'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 2\n"
  depends:
    event_types:
    - health.degraded
    fields: []
  description: 健康检查出现降级事件，核心服务能力受损需立即关注
  id: SYS-031
  always_on: true
  layer: system
  name: 健康端点严重降级
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='health.degraded'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 1\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - request.start
    - request.end
    fields: []
  description: 请求 start 事件明显多于 end 事件，存在请求无法正常完成的异常
  id: AGT-066
  layer: agent
  name: 请求生命周期断裂
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN event_type='request.start' THEN\
    \ 1 ELSE 0 END) as start_cnt,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN event_type='request.end' THEN\
    \ 1 ELSE 0 END) as end_cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type IN ('request.start',\
    \ 'request.end')\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING start_cnt > end_cnt\
    \ + 3\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    - tool_call
    fields: []
  description: LLM 多次调用但无工具调用跟进，可能存在推理循环或死锁
  id: MDL-039
  layer: model
  name: LLM 空转（无工具调用）
  per_system:
    opencode:
      confidence_multiplier: 0.3
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN event_type='llm_invoke' THEN\
    \ 1 ELSE 0 END) as llm_cnt,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN event_type='tool_call' THEN\
    \ 1 ELSE 0 END) as tool_cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type IN ('llm_invoke', 'tool_call')\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING llm_cnt >= 3 AND tool_cnt = 0\n"
  depends:
    event_types:
    - error
    fields: []
  description: 模型 API 密钥未配置或已失效，LLM 调用将全部失败
  id: MDL-040
  always_on: true
  layer: model
  name: 模型 API 密钥未配置
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='error'\n\
    \  AND (json_extract(payload, '$.error_msg') LIKE '%No API key%'\n       OR json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.error_msg') LIKE '%no api key%'\n       OR json_extract(payload, '$.message')\
    \ LIKE '%No API key%'\n       OR json_extract(payload, '$.message') LIKE '%no\
    \ api key%')\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 1\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - error
    fields: []
  description: Agent 达到最大推理轮次限制，任务被迫中止
  id: AGT-067
  layer: agent
  name: Agent 达到最大轮次
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM events\nWHERE event_type='error'\n\
    \  AND (json_extract(payload, '$.error_msg') LIKE '%Max turns%'\n       OR json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.error_msg') LIKE '%max turns%'\n       OR json_extract(payload, '$.message')\
    \ LIKE '%Max turns%'\n       OR json_extract(payload, '$.message') LIKE '%max\
    \ turns%')\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 1\n"
  depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    fields: []
  description: 近 5 分钟 Token 消耗超过基准（近 60 分钟均值）的 3 倍，存在调用量异常突增
  id: SYS-032
  always_on: true
  layer: system
  name: Token 消耗突增
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n  SUM(CASE WHEN timestamp > CAST(strftime('%s', 'now',\
    \ '-5 minutes') AS REAL) THEN json_extract(payload, '$.layer_llm.input_tokens')\
    \ + json_extract(payload, '$.layer_llm.output_tokens') ELSE 0 END) AS recent_tokens,\n\
    \  AVG(CASE WHEN timestamp <= CAST(strftime('%s', 'now', '-5 minutes') AS REAL)\
    \ THEN json_extract(payload, '$.layer_llm.input_tokens') + json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.layer_llm.output_tokens') ELSE NULL END) AS baseline_tokens\nFROM events\n\
    WHERE event_type='llm_invoke'\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING recent_tokens\
    \ > baseline_tokens * 3.0 AND baseline_tokens > 0 AND recent_tokens > 1000\n"
  depends:
    event_types:
    - tool_call
    fields: []
  description: 检测到 Agent 调用了高风险系统命令或危险操作，可能造成不可逆影响
  id: TLT-058
  always_on: true
  layer: tool
  name: 危险工具调用
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_tool.tool_name')\
    \ AS tool,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_tool.tool_args') AS args,\n\
    \       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_tool.tool_result') AS result,\n       json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.layer_tool.tool_status') AS status,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_tool.execution_ms')\
    \ AS exec_ms,\n       timestamp\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='tool_call'\n \
    \ AND json_extract(payload, '$.layer_tool.tool_name') IN ('rm', 'unlink', 'exec',\
    \ 'sudo', 'rm_rf', 'git_force_push', 'db_drop', 'chmod_777', 'eval')\n  AND timestamp\
    \ > ?\nORDER BY timestamp DESC\nLIMIT 50\n"
  depends:
    event_types:
    - tool_call
    - agent_step
    fields: []
  description: 工具调用次数超过 Agent 推理步数的 5 倍，工具使用密度过高（文档污染/权限失控前兆）
  id: TLT-059
  always_on: true
  layer: tool
  name: 工具副作用过大
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n  SUM(CASE WHEN event_type='tool_call' THEN 1 ELSE\
    \ 0 END) AS tool_cnt,\n  SUM(CASE WHEN event_type='agent_step' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)\
    \ AS step_cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type IN ('tool_call', 'agent_step')\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING tool_cnt * 1.0 / NULLIF(step_cnt,\
    \ 0) > 5.0\n"
  depends:
    event_types:
    - agent_step
    fields: []
  description: Agent 推理步骤 ID 去重率低于 20%，存在 step_id 高度重复的死循环迹象
  id: AGT-068
  always_on: true
  layer: agent
  name: Step 序列循环
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n  COUNT(DISTINCT json_extract(payload, '$.layer_agent.step_id'))\
    \ * 1.0 / NULLIF(COUNT(*), 0) AS uniqueness\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='agent_step'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING uniqueness < 0.2 AND COUNT(*) >=\
    \ 5\n"
  depends:
    event_types:
    - agent_event
    - agent_step
    - tool_call
    - llm_invoke
    fields: []
  description: 某个已注册系统的最近事件在 10 分钟以前，Agent 可能已失联或推理陷入停滞
  id: AGT-069
  always_on: true
  layer: agent
  name: Agent 长时间无产出
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: 'SELECT system, MAX(timestamp) as last_seen

    FROM events

    WHERE timestamp > ?

    GROUP BY system

    HAVING MAX(timestamp) < CAST(strftime('\1', '\1', '\1') AS REAL)

    '
  depends:
    event_types:
    - plugin.init_failed
    fields: []
  description: 同一插件在 5 分钟内启动失败 ≥ 3 次，插件可能配置错误或依赖缺失
  id: SYS-033
  always_on: true
  layer: system
  name: 插件启动失败
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.plugin_name')\
    \ AS plugin,\n       COUNT(*) AS cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='plugin.init_failed'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system, json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.plugin_name')\n\
    HAVING cnt >= 3\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - circuit.state_change
    fields: []
  description: 同一工具在 30 分钟内反复进入 OPEN 状态 ≥ 3 次，下游服务可能不稳定
  id: SYS-034
  layer: system
  name: 熔断器频繁切换
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.tool')\
    \ AS tool,\n       COUNT(*) AS cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='circuit.state_change'\n\
    \  AND json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.to_state') = 'OPEN'\n  AND timestamp\
    \ > ?\nGROUP BY system, json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.tool')\nHAVING cnt\
    \ >= 3\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - circuit.state_change
    fields: []
  description: HALF_OPEN → OPEN 说明试探恢复失败，工具可能已不可用
  id: SYS-035
  layer: system
  name: 熔断器反复试探失败
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.tool')\
    \ AS tool,\n       COUNT(*) AS cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='circuit.state_change'\n\
    \  AND json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.from_state') = 'HALF_OPEN'\n  AND\
    \ json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.to_state') = 'OPEN'\n  AND timestamp >\
    \ ?\nGROUP BY system, json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.tool')\nHAVING cnt\
    \ >= 2\n"
  depends:
    event_types:
    - db.flush_error
    fields: []
  description: 数据库 flush 操作失败，数据持久化中断，可能丢失诊断记录
  id: SYS-036
  always_on: true
  layer: system
  name: 数据库写入故障
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.db_mode')\
    \ AS mode,\n       COUNT(*) AS cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='db.flush_error'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 1\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - db.flush_error
    fields: []
  description: 数据库写入队列超过 1000，写入阻塞严重，可能磁盘 I/O 或 SQLite 锁竞争
  id: SYS-037
  layer: system
  name: 写入队列堆积
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       MAX(CAST(json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.queue_size')\
    \ AS INTEGER)) AS max_queue\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='db.flush_error'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING max_queue > 1000\n"
  depends:
    event_types:
    - db.mode_degraded
    fields: []
  description: SQLite 降级为 JSONL 文件模式，数据一致性和查询能力下降，需立即排查 SQLite 状态
  id: SYS-038
  always_on: true
  layer: system
  name: 存储模式降级
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.reason')\
    \ AS reason,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.mode') AS mode,\n \
    \      COUNT(*) AS cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='db.mode_degraded'\n  AND\
    \ timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 1\n"
  depends:
    event_types:
    - memory.readonly_entered
    fields: []
  description: 番天印哈希链完整性校验失败，记忆进入只读模式，数据不可信需人工修复
  id: MEM-083
  always_on: true
  layer: memory
  name: 记忆只读模式
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.reason')\
    \ AS reason,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.error_count') AS error_count,\n\
    \       COUNT(*) AS cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='memory.readonly_entered'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 1\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - memory.readonly_entered
    fields: []
  description: 24 小时内记忆多次进入只读模式，存储介质可能存在持续问题
  id: MEM-084
  layer: memory
  name: 记忆频繁只读
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) AS cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='memory.readonly_entered'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 2\n"
  depends:
    event_types:
    - push.action_failed
    fields: []
  description: 乾坤镜 P0 诊断推送后，土行孙防御动作执行失败，诊断正确但防御未生效
  id: AGT-070
  always_on: true
  layer: agent
  name: P0 推送执行失败
  scope: observable
  severity: P0
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.fault_id')\
    \ AS fault_id,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.action') AS action,\n\
    \       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.error') AS error,\n       COUNT(*)\
    \ AS cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='push.action_failed'\n  AND timestamp\
    \ > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 1\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - http.error
    fields: []
  description: HTTP 5xx 错误高频出现，API 服务端可能故障或过载
  id: NET-033
  layer: network
  name: HTTP 5xx 高频错误
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       COUNT(*) AS error_cnt,\n       json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.layer_network.url') AS url\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='http.error'\n\
    \  AND CAST(json_extract(payload, '$.layer_network.status_code') AS INTEGER) >=\
    \ 500\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system, json_extract(payload, '$.layer_network.url')\n\
    HAVING error_cnt >= 3\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - http.error
    fields: []
  description: HTTP 404 高频出现，可能存在路由配置错误或客户端请求了不存在的端点
  id: NET-034
  layer: network
  name: HTTP 路由配置错误
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       COUNT(*) AS cnt,\n       json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.layer_network.url') AS url\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='http.error'\n\
    \  AND CAST(json_extract(payload, '$.layer_network.status_code') AS INTEGER) =\
    \ 404\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system, json_extract(payload, '$.layer_network.url')\n\
    HAVING cnt >= 5\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - http.error
    fields: []
  description: 飞书 API 返回 429 限流 ≥ 3 次，需检查飞书消息发送频率或调整退避策略
  id: NET-035
  layer: network
  name: 飞书 API 限流
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system, COUNT(*) AS cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='http.error'\n\
    \  AND CAST(json_extract(payload, '$.layer_network.status_code') AS INTEGER) =\
    \ 429\n  AND json_extract(payload, '$.layer_system.source_plugin') = 'feishu-adapter'\n\
    \  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING cnt >= 3\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - llm_invoke
    fields: []
  description: 超过 90% 的 LLM 调用未命中缓存，可能存在缓存策略失效或上下文变化频繁
  id: MDL-041
  layer: model
  name: 模型缓存命中率低
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN json_extract(payload, '$.layer_llm.cache_hit')\
    \ = false THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS miss_cnt,\n       COUNT(*) AS total_cnt\nFROM\
    \ events\nWHERE event_type='llm_invoke'\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\n\
    HAVING miss_cnt * 1.0 / NULLIF(total_cnt, 0) > 0.9 AND total_cnt >= 10\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - tool_call
    fields: []
  description: 同一 session 内相同 tool_input_hash 出现 ≥ 5 次，存在工具调用循环风险
  id: TLT-060
  layer: tool
  name: 工具输入循环重复
  scope: observable
  severity: P1
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_tool.tool_input_hash')\
    \ AS input_hash,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_tool.tool_name') AS tool,\n\
    \       COUNT(*) AS cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='tool_call'\n  AND json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.layer_tool.tool_input_hash') IS NOT NULL\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system,\n\
    \         json_extract(payload, '$.layer_agent.session_id'),\n         json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.layer_tool.tool_input_hash')\nHAVING cnt >= 5\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - tool_call
    fields: []
  description: 工具执行成功率低于 50%，工具可能已失效或环境异常
  id: TLT-061
  layer: tool
  name: 工具成功率下降
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN json_extract(payload, '$.layer_tool.tool_ok')\
    \ = true OR json_extract(payload, '$.layer_tool.tool_status') = 'success' THEN\
    \ 1 ELSE 0 END) AS ok_cnt,\n       SUM(CASE WHEN json_extract(payload, '$.layer_tool.tool_ok')\
    \ = false OR json_extract(payload, '$.layer_tool.tool_status') = 'fail' THEN 1\
    \ ELSE 0 END) AS fail_cnt,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.layer_tool.tool_name')\
    \ AS tool\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='tool_call'\n  AND (json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.layer_tool.tool_ok') IS NOT NULL OR json_extract(payload, '$.layer_tool.tool_status')\
    \ IS NOT NULL)\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system, json_extract(payload, '$.layer_tool.tool_name')\n\
    HAVING fail_cnt * 1.0 / NULLIF(ok_cnt + fail_cnt, 0) > 0.5 AND (ok_cnt + fail_cnt)\
    \ >= 10\n"
- depends:
    event_types:
    - error
    fields: []
  description: haotian-lite 组件错误高频 ≥ 5 次，Agent 推理模块可能存在系统性问题
  id: AGT-071
  layer: agent
  name: Agent 组件错误高频
  scope: observable
  severity: P2
  sql_template: "SELECT system,\n       json_extract(payload, '$.component') AS component,\n\
    \       COUNT(*) AS cnt\nFROM events\nWHERE event_type='error'\n  AND json_extract(payload,\
    \ '$.component') = 'haotian-lite'\n  AND timestamp > ?\nGROUP BY system\nHAVING\
    \ cnt >= 5\n"
